# `agents.post_annotation`

Post an AnnotationEvent (canvas/observation) and persist to the annotations collection.

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.annotations.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `event_json` | `string` |

## Returns

`PostAnnotationResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `id` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call agents.post_annotation --json '{ "event_json": "" }'
```

Kind: command.

## Example response

```json
{
  "id": "01J9Z3KR5A8E1D9HFG2P7QXY3M"
}
```
